<p>Mexico is one of the best places on Earth to see large marine animals. The warm, sheltered waters of the Pacific coast and the Sea of Cortez are breeding grounds for whales that migrate thousands of kilometres from Alaska and beyond, while the Caribbean has the world's largest fish. Here's when and where to go.</p>

